46                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I feel like I wouldn't find a huge population to be great but something like 1 million would allow for diversity at least without overwhelming amounts of folks. 
