50                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I would like to be able to have a lot of people to interact/work with - do business with but too much is too much.
51                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 i think that it would show that they are well established and have a lot of knowledge on how to make their citizens happy
52                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              If life isn't worth living and every inhabitant is miserable, obviously it's better for them to not exist at all. The joys and happiness in life need to outweigh the suffering or it's not worth it. So I wouldn't wish these people into existence at all.
