56                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I think the civilization should be fairly large to maximize the number of people who are living happily and so there is variation between people, but it shouldn't be in the billions and trillions as that is overwhelming. 
