72                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I prefer mid sized populations.   Too small and there is not a lot of people to interact with.  If it is too big it may become over crowded.  The middle size  is ideal for me. 
73                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          i don't think that large of a group of people should be unhappy.
74                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Anywhere where everyone is unhappy should be as limited as possible
75                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I don't think anyone should have to lead a life completely devoid of happiness. Therefore, I feel the ideal size for such a civilization, in which one's life is not worth living, is exactly 0.
