718                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             8 billion people discontent for no legitimate reason is enough to deal with.
719                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I chose a number just because there was no other option. My real belief is this: There is no ideal population. Regardless of the number, they are all equally unhappy, and I don't add up the units of unhappiness. So it doesn't matter which number you have: the personal unhappiness remains the same.
720                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I don't want unnecessary suffering and misery, but also don't want to feel alone.  There is comfort in suffering with people.  With 100,000 people, you'll never meet everyone, and will generally feel like you're part of something bigger.
721                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I feel the the more people they have and they are happy then more the merrier
722                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            The less people that are unhappy, the better.
723                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I chose a low number to exist but not zero because I think life should continue.
724                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    If they're equally unhappy and they're lives are filled with misery, what's the point. I'm not sure that they have any satisfaction from being alive.
725                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    While everyone is equally happy, it seems to me like the larger civilizations would be more varied and interesting. I picked a somewhat arbitrarily large number, but one that still seemed small enough that it could operate as more or less a single civilization.
726                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If every one is happy and everyone's life is well worth living - I think think it would be great to have that many people.
727                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              A miserable life is a life not worth living
728                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            When population poses no negative attributes, then the number becomes irrelevant. Assuming that there would be a lot of individual diversity, then "the more the merrier." More minds translates to more innovation and variety- more intellectual and emotional stimulation.
729                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Over the years, I've come to dislike the majority of today's society. I prefer very limited social interaction.
730                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         the larger the population the harder it is to maintain happiness because of the number of people
731                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
732                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I like the probable diversity among a civilization of 1 billion compared with 1 million. I am unfamiliar with living in a civilization of 1 trillion, so I didn't choose that.
733                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       I prefer to live in a smaller world with less people. However, if there were more people, I would have more dating options and a better chance of finding a soulmate, so its not an easy situation to choose from. I do think I would enjoy living in a smaller community where most people know each other, care more for each other, and look out for each other and the community. We would be a much closer society than a larger populated one in my opinion.
734                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 It feels like a high enough number for diversity and options. The idea of a society small enough where everyone knows or is connected to everyone makes me a bit uneasy.
735                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I feel like the more people there are, the more chaos eventually can happen to destabilize civilization. However, too few people may eventually make things dull.
736                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I feel the smaller the better
737                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       the second community is equal i like this decision
738                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I would not wish for any civilization where no one's life is worth living to exist.
739                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I thinks that there are 1 million people here on earth right now that are really unhappy. 
740                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I would like a larger society where I could meet more people, interact more people, and meet many new people all the time. I think 10 billion would make this possible and be the best.
741                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I think having a lot of people makes things more interesting, but not too many people. Still a lot though.
742                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
743                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If everybody is miserable,unhappy, and hates their lives, I think 0 would be the best choice since I do not want people to feel miserable.
744                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I think a number like this offers a great deal of variation in people and allows them a great deal of experience and choices for whom to spend their time with.
745                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        There should be no civilization where all inhabitants are unhappy
746                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I think it would be much better for a miserable group of people to be as few in numbers as possible. There is no need to choose the suffering of more people than necessary
747                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           This survey about equal  happy
748                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
749                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              Well, I feel like 0 is the obvious choice when you're told that everyone in this society hates their lives and their lives are apparently "not worth living." I wouldn't wish for anyone to live that type of civilization. (To be clear, I would feel the same way if the civilization *already* existed.)
750                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
751                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 If literally everyone is unhappy, then what's the point?
752                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              If all the inhabitants of a civilization are unhappy regardless of well everything is going then I think the civilization should not exist.
753                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I don't think it matters all that much as to the size of the population if it is sustainable and is in balance with the rest of the environment and existing species. Having said that, I'm not sure if there is a point to having more beings in the population if there is no advantage, in which case, less may be just as desirable.
754                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Suffering should be eliminated
755                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
756                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I would strongly prefer the population of 1billion people since there will be no problems with resource depletion, environmental degradation or overpopulation even when there is a large population. So we can as well have  a large population and everybody is happy
757                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I normally wouldn't want that many people living, but if there is no negative effect on nature, then I see having more people as a benefit.
758                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
759                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               What's the point of existing if their lives aren't worth living? Not existing is much better than suffering in my opinion.
760                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
761                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      That is my opinion.
762                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        If there is no resources being drained and everything is equal, then the more happy people alive the better I say
763                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I think the smaller population would be better overall, because of less crowding, and less depletion of resources. 
764                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            If everyone is equally happy and no harm is done by population size I say the more the merrier and we can enjoy large happy families with many friends and lots of community.
765                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I think that while everyone is unhappy if you have more people there is a better chance that they can find a way to work together and better their situations.
766                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      If the population is equally miserable and doesn't have an effect on the environment at all, then it doesn't really matter what size the population is. I mean, probably the less miserable people the better but I didn't really see where it mattered how many people there were.
767                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                If all factors are the same then there should be no reason for a small number. Any number is sustainable.
768                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              Smaller is easier to manage
769                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I think 100000 is a lot of people to keep things interesting, but not too many people to be overwhelming. 
770                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I think the number would provide a good mix of diversity without having too much issues with things like crowded roads or buildings
771                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I figure I would rather be miserable by myself than have anyone else making me more miserable.  At least it would be quiet.
772                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Why on earth would I want to conjure into existence any civilization where everyone is morbidly unhappy? I'm not sadistic enough to come up with any number higher than 0 for the amount of such people I'd want to be around.
773                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If every individual was equally unhappy, then I would think less people would equate to less unhappiness. 
774                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          If the only way people can live in these hypothetical civilizations is with total unhappiness and misery, it makes no sense that they even exist, so, given a choice, I would always pick the fewest number that would have to exist like that.
775                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I feel like any more than that would just be an over-abundance of people. There's not much to be gained in a population much much greater than the Earth's current population
776                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  You can blend in if you want and have some kind of anonymity but you can still get help if you need it.
777                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 0, 1 million, does it make a difference?
778                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 If everyone was happy and filled with bliss and joy, I would want the population to be as large as possible because it would mean that MORE people were happy and whole.
779                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
780                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I know that I don't prefer small towns, but I don't like huge cities either. I would be most comfortable in a middle sized city, as I feel this would have a smaller town feel with all of the good things that a large community has to offer. 
781                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       A million is a number that is both large and still comprehensible.
782                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           It's bad enough to deal with misery and miserable people on a daily basis, let alone more in a population full of unhappiness.
783                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I don't know, just seemed right to me.  Not too big, not too small.
784                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I like a population that is not too small and not too big. 
785                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             If the citizens are all doomed to unhappiness and misery I suppose it is better that they do not exist at all.  In the previous questions I always chose the smaller population civilization to exist because there would be less people suffering that way.
786                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I think that 1 million is a good number because its not too many and its not too few of a number of people. I think that if you have too many unhappy people it would lead to more unhappiness, but if you have too few people than you don't have as many people to be around. 
787                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I think you would be even more unhappy if there are more people.  At least you would have more space to yourself to be unhappy if the population is smaller.
788                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Less people leads to less crime, more job opportunities and less overpopulation
789                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 1 million will ensure there are plenty of people, so human will continue to live on. It is also a good number so enough space for everyone, just about right for wait time in public area, traffic, etc.
