                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    comments
1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           It was hard to judge because there were no specifics about land area. I believe a billion would bring a diverse class of people.
2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I don't think there is an ideal number for population size if it has no impact on the environment. I really just chose a random number in the last question.
3                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 i  wouldnt  want anyone to be  unhappy.  I  hope  I understood  this  survey correctly.  But  I always  choose  the larger population  because   out of the 2  choices  I  feel  with a larger  population there is more of a  chance to find  happiness  
4                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         It would provide a diversely traited population while still having distinct groups that don't overrun each other. 
5                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         The more people, the more variety, art, music, culture, etc.  The more the better!
6                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 If the people are unhappy and do not feel life is worth living I think it would be better to not bring them into existance in which they will be unhappy. 
7                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I felt the ideal situation is having a community small enough where your voice is heard, but large enough where you dont feel confined. 
8                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                I would not want to be surrounded by an extremely large number of unhappy people, and I would not want to be surrounded by an extremely small number of people. Having 500000 people would perhaps allow me to find a group within this unhappy overall population that I might connect with on some level.
9                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          it would be less people suffering and enough so that society could be able to run
10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         i don't want a lot of unhappiness
11                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   The fewer amount of people generally, the happier I am.
12                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I think 10,000,000 is a reasonable size for a civilization. Not too big and not too small. 
13                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         1 million is an ideal number to keep things running smoothly in the society for the greater good.
14                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   Although my preference for a particular number is very week in this case I chose 1 million as ideal because it is too many people so it wouldn't be crowded, but since everyone is happy and living in harmony I would want a good number of people so that they can all experience that way of living.
15                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       I want to get both a smaller population as having alot of people all unhappy at one time leads to heartbreak. But on the other hand I also want to make sure their are enough people to keep the population alive. 
16                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             1 billion should be the ideal because it makes the civilization a little bit spacious with enough space for interaction and future expansion.
17                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             In a civilization where all people are happy and lead good lives, more people would be somewhat beneficial because each person provides a unique viewpoint and would enrich society. Too many people would mean that a single voice would be difficult to find and not enough would mean a restriction on the number of perspectives offered.
18                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               It is better to have less unhappy people than to have more.
19                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Its what I thought.
20                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             gut feelings.
21                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
22                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I want to have enough people around me but not too many people.
23                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             i like to have more happy people in the world
24                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                Based on not being overcrowded. Resources may be perfect but space is not.
25                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          
