1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 It was hard to judge because there were no specifics about land area. I believe a billion would bring a diverse class of people.
2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I don't think there is an ideal number for population size if it has no impact on the environment. I really just chose a random number in the last question.
3                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               It would provide a diversely traited population while still having distinct groups that don't overrun each other. 
4                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               The more people, the more variety, art, music, culture, etc.  The more the better!
5                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I felt the ideal situation is having a community small enough where your voice is heard, but large enough where you dont feel confined. 
6                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          The fewer amount of people generally, the happier I am.
7                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I think 10,000,000 is a reasonable size for a civilization. Not too big and not too small. 
8                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          Although my preference for a particular number is very week in this case I chose 1 million as ideal because it is too many people so it wouldn't be crowded, but since everyone is happy and living in harmony I would want a good number of people so that they can all experience that way of living.
9                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    1 billion should be the ideal because it makes the civilization a little bit spacious with enough space for interaction and future expansion.
10                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   In a civilization where all people are happy and lead good lives, more people would be somewhat beneficial because each person provides a unique viewpoint and would enrich society. Too many people would mean that a single voice would be difficult to find and not enough would mean a restriction on the number of perspectives offered.
11                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             Its what I thought.
12                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   gut feelings.
13                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   i like to have more happy people in the world
14                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      Based on not being overcrowded. Resources may be perfect but space is not.
15                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                
16                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               One million seems like a good number. There would be a lot of different people for you to interact with. Since there is no resource depletion no matter how big the population is
17                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I don't think there is an ideal number so I picked the largest one on the list
18                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         It seems like a nice amount of people, but not an overwhelming amount\n
19                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I don't want to be surrounded by people. I would prefer to be in a smaller, more contained civilization.
20                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I went with my gut. 
21                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I feel like I wouldn't find a huge population to be great but something like 1 million would allow for diversity at least without overwhelming amounts of folks. 
22                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                If everyone is happy and there are seemingly unlimited resources, I think the more the better.  
23                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I would like to be able to have a lot of people to interact/work with - do business with but too much is too much.
24                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       i think that it would show that they are well established and have a lot of knowledge on how to make their citizens happy
25                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I just like the idea of there being lots of people, but I suppose it doesn't really matter.
