27                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I think the civilization should be fairly large to maximize the number of people who are living happily and so there is variation between people, but it shouldn't be in the billions and trillions as that is overwhelming. 
28                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               The population is diverse enough, but not too large that it would be too crowded.
29                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         They wont have to worry about not being able to control the community. 
30                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         The number can go as high as possible. 
31                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            If they are all happy and it doesn't hurt the environment, then more is better.  It means more joy and happy beings.
32                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I think it is better to have a smaller population
33                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                I think that 1 million is a happy medium between too little and too many people.
34                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I think 1 million is a perfect number to not feel like you are truly alone.
35                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If everyone is happy and there are no issues with resources and overpopulation- then any size works. There can be no preference. 
36                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                I prefer mid sized populations.   Too small and there is not a lot of people to interact with.  If it is too big it may become over crowded.  The middle size  is ideal for me. 
37                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Smaller populations are always easier to control and manage.
38                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    I think 10K people really isn't enough to socialize properly but I don't want a world thats over burdened with people either
