41                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I am pro environment so I'd rather have this society take over our current one before the planet entirely degrades
42                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I think we over one million people, there may be too many differences and more conflict between people. 
43                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    it seems like the perfect amount not too much not too little
44                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                one million seems like a good number. there are many more variables that are not explained, so this is my guess.
45                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I don't really have a preference because no matter the size, all inhabitants are equally happy.
46                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                It is a big enough number to where there are plenty of people for others to enjoy but not so many where it becomes overwhelming 
47                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I guess I chose bigger civilizations so there'd be a bigger gene pool, but not sure if that was even an issue in these perfect civilizations..
48                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I think 1,000,000 is a good number for a population to prosper economically but yet not be overrun with too much population as long as there is enough geographically space.  
49                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          i think the more people the better because it makes the world a better place when they can share and relate to others.
50                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I think a society with a lot of people is a good thing as long as everyone's needs are met.
51                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  As long as they are all happy and comfortable, a large society would be great.
52                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           The more the merrier.
53                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I think that one billion people is probably quite enough to keep the human race going and to offer a variety of personalities, attributes, talents. 
54                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I think the more people involved in happiness of a nation, the better.
55                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Because if there is absolutely no downside to a larger population, then the more happy people there are in the world, the better. I really feel like there's no actual cap, though I can't wrap my head around an infinite number of people.
56                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               Even though everyone is happy, I'd like enough people for diversity and to run into others but not be crowded in.
57                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I was not really sure what to respond, because if they are all happy and not hurting the environment, there could be as many people as youd like. no preference. 
58                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   there are enough people to keep the entire population from going extinct if something should happen but, there are not too many people around
59                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I would need more thought on this as if there is space and resources, why does it matter how many?!
60                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                I think 3 million is a reasonable amount in order for citizens to be happy in their civilization
61                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I don't generally like large groups of people. I don't really know why I chose 138, but something about that number just seems appealing to me.
62                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        One million is good but I think it's a little small to have enough people to really explore every aspect of their world yet still do all the other jobs that are necessary. In my experience, cities of 10 million people are too crazy and complex, I prefer smaller world populations and enough people to see everything that the world has to offer.
63                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I would like to have a society with a variety of people to be different and have different jobs.  It would allow for more diversity.
64                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          It\342\200\231s a gut feeling that 1billion is a lot but not too many.
65                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I feel like a million people is the ideal size, even in these civilizations where everyone feels bliss. I say this because I feel like that is enough people where you can have diversity in thought and creativity and so on, which will result in a more interesting society that fosters more innovations and so on. I feel like having many more than that might result in "too many" differences.
66                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         nothing
67                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 If everything is in harmony, no environmental degradation, and everyone is totally happy, the more the merrier.
68                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I think it needs to be big enough for some variety but not too big
69                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I am pretty much someone who likes to spend time by myself but do occasionally like to have human interaction. I think a million people is large enough to see other people but small enough that you don't feel like you're being smothered.
70                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I would rather live in an area where the population is not as dense. 
71                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I always tried to pick the bigger civilization however in my mind 10 billion was too big so i didn't choose that one 
