335                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     One million is not too small and not too large for a population.  If there are too many people, life is crowded and it takes time do things (e.g., waiting in lines).  If there are too few people, there are not enough brains with ideas to solve problems that are encountered in life.
336                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                Not sure why I feel that way. I guess less people sounds good right now, based on the state of the world and the destruction of the environment. (despite the idyllic scenario)
337                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            It is better if more people can live lives of happiness. So higher numbers are better in my opinion
338                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          I do not believe in too much population. The fewer the people, the more happy they will be . The more the people the more likely problems will arise.
339                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       I think that 12,000 is enough people but also makes it so that it isn't too overcrowded.
340                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    I think that too many people on earth is a problem, and needs to significantly be lowered. 1B people is too much, I feel like 25000000 is more meaningful to the population
341                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                I guess if I really think about it, the more people the better, assuming everyone will actually remain happy, because everyone can find a friend and/or spouse.
342                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I think ten million is a good number where it is a lot of people but not too much, it is a comfortable number close to the population of New York City.
343                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I think a million people is just right!  I want to move to Montana, and that's about the population of the whole state. There are big towns if you want to go to one, but there's tons of open space and wilderness, with plenty of room for people to enjoy nature.
344                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             It just seems like a  good amount of people for diversity but not too many people.
345                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Even with the assumed bountiful nature of resources there would still be a matter of space that could affect quality of life negatively if said space was scant. I feel 10 billion would mean people were crammed in together and would think a lower population would allow more individual space and freedom further enhancing the lives of the population.
346                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         If everyone is equally happy the bigger the number the better it seems, up until there just isn't any room left. So the max while there is still room.
347                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I don't have any real preference for the size of a population.  I don't think it can matter objectively.  A population of 10 or 10 million can have worth.
348                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Because I would want to have enough people that if there were any problems we would be able to solve them. That might not be the case if we do not have enough man power or brain power.
349                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          If everybody is happy and nobody is suffering from any effects of overpopulation, than I'd like to think there should be as many people as possible experiencing happy, fulfilled lives. More people also likely means more technological and medical advancements, more great ideas.
350                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I think if regardless of population size everyone is happy and joyful, a million sounds like a good number.  I'm not one for huge crowds, so the 10 billion people sounded too crowded for me.
351                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I think that would be an ideal answer without being too much
352                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              A population of 30 million people is a healthy number to exist. If the population is bigger than some nations may perceive them as a threat and attempt to pressure them into war. With 30 million people they can build a thriving country and exchange their knowledge and ideas without being seen as a threat
353                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            A million doesn't seem like that when you think about the size of actual countries, for instance, but a billion seems a bit too big
354                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I meant to put 10,000 but accidentally put a 9 at the end.\nI prefer smaller populations/societies.
355                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I feel as though the absolute perfect amount would be 1 billion people in a civilization. (10 billion would be better only if they were the only civilization on the planet.) 1 billion people is a little smaller than China or India and I think that is a good size where you have enough of a population spread in order to field enough scientists, doctors, etc.
356                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I grew up watching Star Wars (before Disney) and would enjoy living in what I would assume to be a galactic civilization that had space ships and advanced technology.  More people means more ideas, more things to do, and an always-changing community.
357                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            One billion seemed like a good number, not to many and not too less
358                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      In the last question, I wanted to say "As many as possible", but had to enter a number so I went big. If the civilizations are full of bliss and happiness, and don't experience issues such as resource depletion, why not make as many people as possible share in it. 
359                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I am a quiet and reserved person who does not like big crowds. However, I would like a civilization with a decent amount of people so that everyone does not know your business, like smaller civilizations would be. 
360                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       As long as everyone is happy and wants for nothing then I thought that was a good number
361                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Ample people to learn and grow from.
362                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             Since everyone is happy, healthy and having a blissful life, its almost a "the more the merrier" situation. But thinking about it, looking at a trillion people, I felt that was pushing too much 
363                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I think there should be a lot of people, this leads to more variety and more social opportunities.
364                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I think a population of 1 billion would be ideal as this would allow people to have space, but also plenty of people to be around. Our current population is too much, so you get overcrowded areas like in India. 
365                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               1 million would seem a decent amount of people to have great differences between them to make for decent culture
366                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I feel the the more people they have and they are happy then more the merrier
367                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          While everyone is equally happy, it seems to me like the larger civilizations would be more varied and interesting. I picked a somewhat arbitrarily large number, but one that still seemed small enough that it could operate as more or less a single civilization.
368                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     If every one is happy and everyone's life is well worth living - I think think it would be great to have that many people.
369                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  When population poses no negative attributes, then the number becomes irrelevant. Assuming that there would be a lot of individual diversity, then "the more the merrier." More minds translates to more innovation and variety- more intellectual and emotional stimulation.
370                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                Over the years, I've come to dislike the majority of today's society. I prefer very limited social interaction.
