373                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I like the probable diversity among a civilization of 1 billion compared with 1 million. I am unfamiliar with living in a civilization of 1 trillion, so I didn't choose that.
374                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I prefer to live in a smaller world with less people. However, if there were more people, I would have more dating options and a better chance of finding a soulmate, so its not an easy situation to choose from. I do think I would enjoy living in a smaller community where most people know each other, care more for each other, and look out for each other and the community. We would be a much closer society than a larger populated one in my opinion.
375                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       It feels like a high enough number for diversity and options. The idea of a society small enough where everyone knows or is connected to everyone makes me a bit uneasy.
376                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I feel like the more people there are, the more chaos eventually can happen to destabilize civilization. However, too few people may eventually make things dull.
377                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I feel the smaller the better
378                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             the second community is equal i like this decision
379                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I would like a larger society where I could meet more people, interact more people, and meet many new people all the time. I think 10 billion would make this possible and be the best.
