386                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        I would strongly prefer the population of 1billion people since there will be no problems with resource depletion, environmental degradation or overpopulation even when there is a large population. So we can as well have  a large population and everybody is happy
387                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    I normally wouldn't want that many people living, but if there is no negative effect on nature, then I see having more people as a benefit.
