395                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  I feel like any more than that would just be an over-abundance of people. There's not much to be gained in a population much much greater than the Earth's current population
396                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       If everyone was happy and filled with bliss and joy, I would want the population to be as large as possible because it would mean that MORE people were happy and whole.
