253                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I think that a smaller civilization of unhappy people would be better. They'd be less likely to act up and harm the environment and themselves. They might also have a greater chance at achieving happiness eventually, since they have to deal with fewer other people and have more shares of resources per person.
