258                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    My sense is a smaller population might foster greater intimacy. That is to say, a greater possibility of mutual sharing of why each citizen feels unhappy. As such, a breakthrough might be made as to an alternative to unhappiness.
