335                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I believe that happiness and unhappiness are in the mind. With larger population, the aggregate happiness would be the same, but there would be more of a chance for someone to find an idea to make people happy, or explore that thought. 
336                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           If no one is happy, it makes no sense to have so many unhappy people.  I put just enough to continue existence but not to overburden anything.
337                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     I think 1 million is a good number.  If we are all unhappy, then the least you can do is have some company to go along with your unhappiness.  I think 10000 is too little because that would create more loneliness and sprout even more unhappiness.  I believe 1000000 is the medium - not too much, not too little.  If there are too many, then there are just too many negatives in the world.
338                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        It was hard because I believe everyone exists for a reason. However, if they are that unhappy maybe its best there are as few of them as possible
339                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              If everyone is miserable, what's the point?
340                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             If there were too many people then they would probably fight with each other to make things better. If not enough people then there would not be enough to overthrow the current conditions.
341                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        If they are always unhappy they would be better off not existing.
342                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I figure a nice sized population is a great city. I don't really think there is a specific correct number. 1 million just feels right.
343                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                No one should exist just to be miserable.
344                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       I want there to be enough people for there to be constant accessible change but if were all unhappy theres no reason to be overflowing with people, lets get out of eachothers way
345                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   If everyone is unhappy and miserable, why should anyone bother living?
346                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I guess if everyone is unhappy, the smaller number of people would be better.
347                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             There should be happy people around, it would be a terrible life to be unhappy all the time.
348                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    I guess I feel that if there exists any civilization, people must find a way to work together towards happiness. What's the point of any existence at all if people are miserable? I certainly would not want to be a part of that type of existence.
349                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 I think that even if the population is unhappy, it may be possible for them to improve their lives and remedy that problem. Having a bigger population would likely help with that, and prevent any other issues arising from having a small population.
350                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
351                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   I would not want people to be unhappy.
352                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I choose 100 population size for the civilization because that still sustains the civilization in the meanwhile there are least possible people suffering.
353                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             8 billion people discontent for no legitimate reason is enough to deal with.
354                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I chose a number just because there was no other option. My real belief is this: There is no ideal population. Regardless of the number, they are all equally unhappy, and I don't add up the units of unhappiness. So it doesn't matter which number you have: the personal unhappiness remains the same.
355                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            I don't want unnecessary suffering and misery, but also don't want to feel alone.  There is comfort in suffering with people.  With 100,000 people, you'll never meet everyone, and will generally feel like you're part of something bigger.
356                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            The less people that are unhappy, the better.
357                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I chose a low number to exist but not zero because I think life should continue.
358                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    If they're equally unhappy and they're lives are filled with misery, what's the point. I'm not sure that they have any satisfaction from being alive.
359                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              A miserable life is a life not worth living
360                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I would not wish for any civilization where no one's life is worth living to exist.
361                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               I thinks that there are 1 million people here on earth right now that are really unhappy. 
362                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
363                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If everybody is miserable,unhappy, and hates their lives, I think 0 would be the best choice since I do not want people to feel miserable.
364                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        There should be no civilization where all inhabitants are unhappy
365                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I think it would be much better for a miserable group of people to be as few in numbers as possible. There is no need to choose the suffering of more people than necessary
366                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              Well, I feel like 0 is the obvious choice when you're told that everyone in this society hates their lives and their lives are apparently "not worth living." I wouldn't wish for anyone to live that type of civilization. (To be clear, I would feel the same way if the civilization *already* existed.)
367                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 If literally everyone is unhappy, then what's the point?
368                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              If all the inhabitants of a civilization are unhappy regardless of well everything is going then I think the civilization should not exist.
369                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Suffering should be eliminated
370                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
371                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
372                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               What's the point of existing if their lives aren't worth living? Not existing is much better than suffering in my opinion.
373                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      That is my opinion.
374                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      I think the smaller population would be better overall, because of less crowding, and less depletion of resources. 
375                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           I think that while everyone is unhappy if you have more people there is a better chance that they can find a way to work together and better their situations.
376                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      If the population is equally miserable and doesn't have an effect on the environment at all, then it doesn't really matter what size the population is. I mean, probably the less miserable people the better but I didn't really see where it mattered how many people there were.
377                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              I figure I would rather be miserable by myself than have anyone else making me more miserable.  At least it would be quiet.
378                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Why on earth would I want to conjure into existence any civilization where everyone is morbidly unhappy? I'm not sadistic enough to come up with any number higher than 0 for the amount of such people I'd want to be around.
379                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               If every individual was equally unhappy, then I would think less people would equate to less unhappiness. 
380                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          If the only way people can live in these hypothetical civilizations is with total unhappiness and misery, it makes no sense that they even exist, so, given a choice, I would always pick the fewest number that would have to exist like that.
381                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  You can blend in if you want and have some kind of anonymity but you can still get help if you need it.
382                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 0, 1 million, does it make a difference?
383                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         
384                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           It's bad enough to deal with misery and miserable people on a daily basis, let alone more in a population full of unhappiness.
385                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             If the citizens are all doomed to unhappiness and misery I suppose it is better that they do not exist at all.  In the previous questions I always chose the smaller population civilization to exist because there would be less people suffering that way.
386                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         I think that 1 million is a good number because its not too many and its not too few of a number of people. I think that if you have too many unhappy people it would lead to more unhappiness, but if you have too few people than you don't have as many people to be around. 
387                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             I think you would be even more unhappy if there are more people.  At least you would have more space to yourself to be unhappy if the population is smaller.
